  "content": "# JARVIS environment template.  Copy to \".env\" and edit.  NEVER commit .env.\n# Anything left blank is simply not used - the app stays fully offline-capable.\n\n# ---- Optional cloud brain (off until you add a key AND set ALLOW_CLOUD) ----\nGEMINI_API_KEY=\nALLOW_CLOUD=0\n\n# ---- Optional search provider (DuckDuckGo works with no key at all) --------\nBRAVE_API_KEY=\n\n# ---- Local model ------------------------------------------------------------\nOLLAMA_HOST=http://127.0.0.1:11434\nOLLAMA_MODEL=qwen2.5:1.5b\n\n# ---- Whisper ----------------------------------------------------------------\nWHISPER_MODEL=tiny.en\nWHISPER_LANGUAGE=en\n\n# ---- Wake word (only if you trained/downloaded a model) -------------------\nWAKE_MODEL_DIR=\n\n# ---- Privacy ----------------------------------------------------------------\nPRIVACY_MODE=0\nOFFLINE_MODE=0\nSTORE_TRANSCRIPTS=1\n"
